#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
tome_phase8.py - Full-site i18n migration for Tome (EN <-> FA), phase 8.
Run from the repo root (the folder that contains web/):

    python tome_phase8.py           # dry-run (reports only, changes nothing)
    python tome_phase8.py --apply   # apply changes (originals backed up to .tome_backup_*)

Phase 1 replaces 4 fully-rewritten files (lib/i18n.tsx with a 450-key dictionary,
Navbar, BookshelfView, PipelineView). Phase 2 applies ~400 exact-match
replacements to the remaining views/components so every hardcoded English
string becomes t('key'). Any file whose match-rate is below 50%% is skipped
(wrong version / already patched) and reported.
"""
